1	// dqi.rs — Decoded Quantum Interferometry (DQI) operator
2	//
3	// Word: ⊢∈∈≻⋈⊤⊤⊥∋≺⋈∋⊣⊙  (double-⊤ form, period 14, kernel-verified)
4	// Single-⊤ variant: ⊢∈∈≻⋈⊤⊥∋≺⋈∋⊣⊙  (period 13)
5	// Triple-⊤ variant: ⊢∈∈≻⋈⊤⊤⊤⊥∋≺⋈∋⊣⊙  (period 15)
6	// Pattern: each additional ⊤ in the deposit phase extends the ROTAT period by 1.
7	//
8	// The DQI word implements QFT-induced constructive interference on
9	// high-objective symbol strings, reduced to syndrome decoding for the
10	// LDPC code C⊥ = {d∈F₂ᵐ : Bd=0} with up to ℓ errors.
11	//
12	// B4 verdict: T=closure (objective-met), F=no-closure, B=paradice.
13	// Tuple: ⟨𐑨𐑶𐑽𐑿𐑐𐑘𐑔𐑠⊙𐑖𐑙𐑭⟩ — dqi_algorithm (catalog).
