131	\label{cor:half}
132	Under the hypotheses of \Cref{thm:main}, $\displaystyle \sum_{a \in A} a \;\ge\;
133	\frac12 \cdot 2^{|A|}$.
134	\end{corollary}
135	
136	\begin{proof}
137	For $|A| \ge 1$, $2^{|A|} - 1 \ge \tfrac12 \cdot 2^{|A|}$ exactly when
138	$2^{|A|-1} \ge 1$, which always holds; the two bounds agree in strength for the
139	sets this paper is about and \Cref{cor:half} is the form used downstream.
140	\end{proof}
