           prime_winding verdict    Frobenius verdict and tri-ancestral reading\n\
           prime_winding artifact   ob3ect + Lean scaffold paths\n\
           prime_winding help       this help",
        WORD, PERIOD, FROBENIUS_VERDICT, STEP_CAP
    )
}

