123	/// The three outcomes the closure check can reach. Never collapsed to a
124	/// bool: Undetermined is a real, distinct answer (the vacuous case — no
125	/// clear ever fired, so nothing was ever at risk), not a stand-in for
126	/// either Prime or Composite.
