/// anywhere in the landing spectrum of its hex-encoded word's full ROTAT
/// orbit; Undetermined iff the landing is invariant under ROTAT (the same
/// register at every cut — nothing in the word ever responds to where it's
/// read from); Composite otherwise (phase-bearing, but A never reached).
///
